            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
            {"cmd":"text","text":"A friend of mine from Ecruteak gave it to me."},
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
            {"cmd":"text","text":"I bet you can't find this kind of Egg in Johto."},
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
            {"cmd":"text","text":"I thought Professor Elm might be able to tell what this is."},
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "\"He's the best when it comes to the research of Pokémon evolution.\""
            },
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
            {"cmd":"text","text":"That's a quote from the famous Professor Oak."},
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
            {"cmd":"text","text":"You are returning to Professor Elm?"},
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
            {"cmd":"text","text":"Here. Your Pokémon should have some rest."},
